            "review_title": "Review at Quán Beefsteak Only",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6958 contributions\n0\nabsolutely filthy\nNov 2022\nPacked place, was hard to get seating.\nBasically cheaply cooked meat served on a small plate with a bit of lettuce or onion.......and a beer to drink. \nComes thick and fast and I went with two different dishes.....beef and egg, and beef and some lettuce and onion, hats off to the chef there.\nStill though the beef was half decent....and the beers going down nice. But the place was absolutely filthy, no care given to cleaning the floor or tables.......\nCheap as well, about 11 Euros.....for three (small) meat dishes.....and beers\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 24, 2022",
